:classes/:red_dragon_disciple/:requirements_raw = "Red dragon disciple is a [[prestige class]], so certain criteria must be fulfilled before a character may acquire this class. These criteria are the following.\n\n{| style=\"border:none; text-align:left; padding-left:2em;\"\n|-\n! Class:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[bard]] or [[sorcerer]]\n|-\n! Skills:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[lore]] (8 [[rank]]s)\n|}\n\n[[Image:Red Dragon Disciple.jpg|right|A red dragon disciple]]\n\n{| style=\"border:none; text-align:left;\"\n|-\n! Hit die:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[hit dice|d6 to d12]] (see [[hit die increase]])\n|-\n! Skill points:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[skill point|2]]\u00A0+\u00A0[[intelligence]]\u00A0modifier\n|-\n! High saves:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[base save|fortitude, will]]\n|-\n! Base attack:\n|style=\"padding-left:0.8em;\"| [[base attack|middle]] (+3/4 levels)\n|}"
