:feats/:automatic_silent_spell/:description = "This feat allows the character to cast all spells of a given level range without the caster making any sound. This is especially useful if the caster has been silenced. This feat may be taken multiple times:\n* Automatic silent spell I: Cast any level 0 - 3 spell as a silent spell.\n* Automatic silent spell II: Cast any level 4 - 6 spell as a silent spell.\n* Automatic silent spell III: Cast any level 7 - 9 spell as a silent spell."
