:feats/:draconic_armor/:description = "The character becomes more draconic in appearance. His skin develops tiny iridescent scales, nearly invisible. This provides increasing natural armor bonuses to his base armor class.\n{{{!}}class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\"\n{{!}}-\n! class level\n{{!}} 1 {{!}}{{!}} 5 {{!}}{{!}} 8 {{!}}{{!}} 10\n{{!}} 15 {{!}}{{!}} 20 {{!}}{{!}} 25 {{!}}{{!}} 30\n{{!}}-\n! AC bonus\n{{!}} +1 {{!}}{{!}} +2 {{!}}{{!}} +3 {{!}}{{!}} +4\n{{!}} +5 {{!}}{{!}} +6 {{!}}{{!}} +7 {{!}}{{!}} +8\n{{!}}}"
