:feats/:stunning_fist/:unlocks/[1] = :improved_stunning_fist
:feats/:stunning_fist/:use = "selected. [[Monk]]s receive this feat for free at first level, even if they do not meet the prerequisites. As well, monks suffer no attack or damage penalties when using this feat and may use it once per day per [[class level|level]]. [[Construct]]s and [[undead]] are immune to this attack, as are any creatures that are immune to [[critical hit]]s."
:feats/:stunning_fist/:use_raw = "selected. [[Monk]]s receive this feat for free at first level, even if they do not meet the prerequisites. As well, monks suffer no attack or damage penalties when using this feat and may use it once per day per [[class level|level]]. [[Construct]]s and [[undead]] are immune to this attack, as are any creatures that are immune to [[critical hit]]s."
