:feats/:two_weapon_fighting/:bonus_for = #set[:champion_of_torm, :dwarven_defender, :fighter]
:feats/:two_weapon_fighting/:bonus_for_except = #set[]
:feats/:two_weapon_fighting/:description = "A character with this feat reduces the penalties suffered when fighting with two weapons. The normal penalty of -6 to the primary hand and -10 to the off-hand becomes -4 for the primary hand and -8 for the off-hand. The ambidexterity feat further reduces the attack penalty for the second weapon by 4 (to -4/-4). Best results are achieved if the off-hand weapon is light, further reducing the penalty for both the primary and off-hand by 2 (to -2/-2)."
